  "qualificationRequirements": [
    "Execute all three exact configurations on independently pinned current source/toolchain inputs; preserve native configuration, baselines, reports, logs and restoration evidence.",
    "Keep each configuration result independent; no reduced scope/native perTest report is relabeled full Healthcheck qualification.",
    "Strict score is Killed/(Killed+Survived+Timeout+NoCoverage); require at least 90 percent and classify all native outcomes without timeout/ignored/compile-error kill credit.",
    "Review every compile rollback, omitted/ignored/generated mutant and source membership against the full input inventory; retain explicit dispositions and corrective executions where required.",
    "For ASP.NET and Pipes, coverage analysis stays off and actual child session/audit proves the real child loaded its parent instrumented Core and selected mutant; selector, origin and normal lifecycle failures cannot supply credited kills.",
    "Verify passing current baselines, serialized scheduling controls, source before/after equality, restored builds/tests and canonical source preservation.",
    "Broader whole-Core Release, publication history, external Heartbeat/IStartable and other unexecuted matrices remain separate pending obligations."
